522
00:33:51,720 --> 00:34:03,640
And the average of
mc squared over 2

523
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:06,030
I will indicate by epsilon.

524
00:34:06,030 --> 00:34:07,130
It's the heat content.

525
00:34:11,350 --> 00:34:13,280
Or actually, let's
